https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/34948122/cccbbdcfe4ed584827adcfec5e4a49fd0fbf4267.pnghttps://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/34948122/8ff786a00e09e18ab501229e6c2361bffb6e032a.pnghttps://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/34948122/1b8c1ce0c14c93f230de65b6f9a76d3fb2d76079.png

Map02:
- Turned off the chandelier in the Library to create more darkness and left a single light by the scribe table to put more visual focus on it;
- Removed some light crystals from the path leading up to the Magic Ward, replacing it with more purple light that makes it visible from further away and draws attention to it as an important location;
- Reduced the light from the Guard Office and put a stronger light in the cell with the wall crack to make it draw more attention (also added a broken pickaxe by the wall so it better signals what has to be done);
- Cerberi now appear in the later part of the map on all difficulties;

Map03:
- Moved some lights around the Iron Key room to better draw the player's sight to it as they pass by;
- Added two Iron Maidens on all difficulties;

Map05:
- Moved and added some lights to point out important spots;
- The Librarian's corpse now has a blood trail pointing towards the hidden book switch;

Map06:
- Added a trick to skip the "cinematic" part for people who want subsequent playthroughs without going through the story again - see more details here;

Map07:
- Made some slight changes to help with the hidden Bag of Holding optional;

Map08:
- Added some extra textures to make the gate levers of the fort barbican stand out more;
- Added a smoke generator for when the Forge Elemental blows up the Temple's roof, to signal the player that they can now access it.
